Wouldn't it be nice if one of the Nethack options was a random number
seed?  This way if two people wanted to compete for points playing the
exact same characters in the exact same dungeion -- it would add some
competitiveness and be easier then a MUD version of nethack.  The "seeds"
used could even be kept in the logfile to prevent practice and explore
mode could be disallowed.  Cheaters will get around it anyway.

(We might even see articles in r.g.h that say, "62,248 Points as a Valkyrie
with seed 99999 on a PC at 3.1.2--Beat you by 10,000+ points!"  Or, "It's
too bad you didn't see Mjollnir sitting in the shop on level 8!")

What do you think of this idea?  Is it something worth asking the development
team to look into?  I don't know if it would be easy to implement, as I
haven't looked at the source code, but I think it might be fun!
